    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_finish_description_without_bp">Manje uma uthatha ifoni yakho noma uthepha isikrini, ungasebenzisa ubuso bakho ukuze uvule.\n\nUkuvula Ngobuso kusebenza kahle kakhulu uma kunokukhanya okwanele futhi ungafakanga imaski noma izibuko ezimnyama.</string>
