    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_introduction_control_consent_message_1">Wena nengane yakho ningasula imodeli yobuso bayo noma nivale Ukuvula Ngobuso noma kunini Kumasethingi. Amamodeli obuso agcinwa efonini aze asulwe.</string>
    <string name="security_settings_face_enroll_introduction_how_consent_message_1">Ukuvula Ngobuso kusungula imodeli ehlukile yobuso bengane yakho ukuqinisekisa ukuthi yiyo. Ukuze isungule le modeli yobuso ngesikhathi sokusetha, ingane yakho izothatha imifanekiso yobuso bayo ngezindlela ezihlukile.\n\nLapho isebenzisa Ukuvula Ngobuso, imifanekiso isetshenziselwa ukuvuselela imodeli yayo yobuso. Izithombe ezisetshenziselwe ukusungula imodeli yobuso bayo azilokothi zigcinwe, kodwa imodeli yobuso igcinwa ngokuphephile efonini yayo futhi ayilokothi ishiye ifoni. Konke ukucubungula kwenzeka ngokuphepha efonini.</string>
